Run yocto build with calculon
----------------------------------
Considerations:
- Repository must be a git repository, with an ".git" folder. You can simply run "git init" if you've copied the code
- Add job to calculon & ssh to job
- Export environment vars:
    - Export build common vars
export SSTATE_DIR=/tmp/yocto-solidrun/build/${BUILD_NAME}/build/sstate
export SSTATE_MIRRORS="file://.* file:///mnt/embedded/yocto/sstate/PATH"
export DL_DIR=/mnt/embedded/yocto/downloads
export TMPDIR=/tmp/yocto-solidrun/build/${BUILD_NAME}/build/tmp
    - Export build specific vars
export BUILD_NAME=dasgate_orin-nano-a603_prod_encrypt
